ry of the Ghost Face Mask: From Fun World ..."},{"body":"Dec 23, 2024 · Yes, the producers of Scream obtained a license from Fun World to use the Ghost Face mask in the film. This was a crucial step to avoid copyright infringement and ensure the legal use of the mask’s design.","href":"https://necolebitchie.com/did-the-ghost-face-mask-exist-before-scream/","title":"Did the Ghost Face Mask Exist Before Scream? - Necole Bitchie"},{"body":"Welcome to the story of the mask commonly known today as “GhostFace®”, this mask was first designed and created by Alan Geller of Fun World as he also explain’s in the recent documentary ‘Still Screaming’ by Anthony Masi.","href":"https://www.ghostface.co.uk/mask-info/","title":"GhostFace Masks – GhostFace.co.uk – | The Site of GhostFace®"},{"body":"Jan 21, 2022 · Screenwriter Kevin Williamson discussed the origins of the ghostface mask during a special produced for the original \"Scream\" movie's 25th anniversary. Williamson said: \"No one could agree on...","href":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/ghostface-predate-scream/","title":"Did the 'Ghostface' Mask Predate 'Scream'? - Snopes.com"}]}